# Centres to collect LSHE reports from. Copy to centres.conf (keep it off
# version control if it holds real addresses).
#
# One centre per line:  CENTRE_CODE  HOST  [SSH_PORT]  [SSH_USER]
#   CENTRE_CODE  must match KOLIBRI_CENTRE_CODE on that server
#   HOST         the server's NetBird name or address
#   SSH_PORT     default 22
#   SSH_USER     default lshe-reports (the read-only user, see README.md)
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.

CENTRE01  centre01.netbird.example  22  lshe-reports
CENTRE02  100.64.0.12
